---
# var-naming[no-role-prefix] wants role vars prefixed with the role's own
# name (app_*). This role deliberately keeps the mcprack_* prefix instead,
# since these variables map 1:1 onto the mcprack application's own
# /etc/mcprack/env config keys (see roles/app/tasks/configure.yml) and onto
# the mcprack CLI's own vocabulary - renaming them to app_* would obscure
# that mapping for no benefit, since "app" says nothing about what's being
# configured.
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
